This component could use some aria attributes for a11y:
```tsx
  aria-label={`Team selector: ${displayName}`}
  aria-expanded={undefined} {/* Radix handles this, according to bob */}
```

Component re-renders on every team selection even though `teams` array doesn't change.

**Recommendation:** Memoize the `currentTeam` lookup:
```tsx
const currentTeam = useMemo(
  () => (selectedTeam ? teams.find((t) => t.id === selectedTeam) : null),
  [selectedTeam, teams]
);
```

Dropdown content doesn't show loading state when teams are being fetched.

**Recommendation:**
```typescript
<DropdownMenuContent>
  {isLoading && (
    <DropdownMenuItem disabled className="gap-2 p-2">
      <Loader2 className="size-4 animate-spin" />
      Loading teams...
    </DropdownMenuItem>
  )}
  {!isLoading && error && (
    // Error state
  )}
  {!isLoading && !error && (
    // Teams list
  )}
</DropdownMenuContent>
